Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:06:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] CH01: premium content and Ultra subscription plan

- New Ultra plan (tier 5, 7 profiles); plans get tier + maxProfiles.
- Refactor: Shotgun Surgery / duplicated plan data. config/plans.ts (UI)
  and config/subscriptions.ts (server) are now derived from one
  client-safe config/plan-catalog.ts (they had already drifted).
- Replace magic number 5 in profile.create with the plan's maxProfiles.
- New Content Access Rule Chain (lib/access) with PremiumContentRule.
- tRPC chain extended: attachSubscription middleware ->
  subscribedProcedure; new catalogue.checkAccess procedure.
- TMDB facade tags the originals row as premium; ShowModal shows an
  upgrade button instead of Play when access is denied.
- Checkout refuses plans without a configured Stripe price.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
